{"id":"castillo","lemma":"castillo","pos":"noun","rank":1470,"glosses":["castle (a large building that is fortified and contains many defences)"],"ipa":"/kasˈtiʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"castillos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-castillo.wav","examples":[{"text":"El castillo es hermoso.","en":"The castle is beautiful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607913"},{"text":"Me gustan los castillos.","en":"I like castles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440764"},{"text":"Ese castillo es hermoso.","en":"That castle is beautiful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/79695"},{"text":"La mayoría de los castillos tienen un foso rodeándolos.","en":"Most castles have a moat surrounding them.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691613"},{"text":"Este castillo es bonito.","en":"This castle is beautiful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34527"}]}